error-kanban-source-key = Not a source key: { $key }
error-kanban-cross-lane = A card cannot move to another tracker lane.
error-kanban-missing-approval = The move has no current native confirmation.
error-kanban-missing-label = The workflow label must already exist.
error-kanban-move-busy = A move is pending or the move limit is reached.
error-kanban-read-only-move = Pull requests and incomplete tracker evidence cannot be moved.
error-kanban-stale-move = The approved move changed. Prepare and confirm a new plan.
error-kanban-unsafe-label = The workflow label identity is invalid or could remove unrelated labels.
error-kanban-duplicate-source = kanban.sources contains the same tracker repository more than once.
error-kanban-history-incomplete = The history read is incomplete. The last successful sample is kept.
error-kanban-history-limit = The history read exceeds its limit of { $max } records.
error-kanban-history-record = History needs settled tracker records with update times.
error-kanban-history-window = The history cutoff must fall within the last 30 days.
error-kanban-identical-labels = Kanban label names must be distinct.
error-kanban-label = Kanban labels need 1 to { $max } UTF-8 bytes, without commas or control characters.
error-kanban-repository = Kanban sources must name a tracker host and repository.
error-kanban-route = The item does not belong to the worker's tracker source.
error-kanban-selector = Invalid Kanban source selector: { $error }
error-kanban-selector-canonical = Kanban source selectors must use their exact canonical form.
error-kanban-too-many-sources = kanban.sources permits at most { $max } overrides.
error-kanban-unsupported-provider = Kanban does not support { $provider }.
